{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This is a demo for the full game, there will be limited  attacks, upgrades, achievements and abilities compared to the full version. A free artwork pack can be found on our bluesky for creating any content related to the game!</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325010/extras/StoreHeader1.png?t=1747407620\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325010/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1747407620\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325010/extras/StoreHeader2.png?t=1747407620\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325010/extras/Timeout.gif?t=1747407620\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offering you different upgrades and abilities, as well as deciding its own attacks for you to pick from, based on your actions during the game. Pick your favourite way to lose!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325010/extras/StoreHeader3.png?t=1747407620\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325010/extras/SkillTrees.gif?t=1747407620\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make the choice between multiple powers, and grow stronger with each attempt! Featuring 4 skill trees, unlockable difficulties, abilities, attacks and achievements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325010/extras/StoreHeader4.png?t=1747407620\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325010/extras/Discoveries.gif